---
const title = 'Services | USIVA Visa-Readiness Planning';
const description = 'USIVA planning content helps scholars and partners organize documentation, timing, authorization questions, and next steps without promising an immigration outcome.';
const canonical = 'https://usiva.org/services.html';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>{title}</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={canonical} />
    <meta name="robots" content="index,follow" />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:url" content={canonical} />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://usiva.org/assets/usiva-social.svg" />
    <meta property="og:image:alt" content="USIVA — visa-readiness and compliance planning" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0a253f" />
  </head>
  <body class="page page--services">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <div class="utility-bar">
      <div class="wrap utility-bar__inner">
        <span>Planning for study, research, and compliant opportunity.</span>
        <a href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">US Fellows pathway <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="wrap header-inner">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="USIVA home">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">US</span>
          <span class="brand-copy"><strong>USIVA</strong><small>U.S. Immigration &amp; Visa Association</small></span>
        </a>
        <nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
          <a href="/services.html" aria-current="page">Services</a>
          <a href="/about.html">About</a>
          <a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a>
          <a href="/blog.html">Field notes</a>
          <a class="nav-action" href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="main">
      <section class="service-hero">
        <div class="wrap service-hero__grid">
          <div class="service-hero__copy">
            <p class="eyebrow">USIVA / Services</p>
            <h1>Make the next immigration question visible before it becomes urgent.</h1>
            <p class="lede">USIVA is a visa-readiness and compliance-planning companion for international scholars, students, researchers, and the people coordinating a research pathway. The work starts with a clear file, a named decision, and the right person to verify it.</p>
            <div class="actions">
              <a class="button button--gold" href="/contacts.html">Prepare a question</a>
              <a class="button button--quiet" href="/tips-faq.html">Read the boundaries</a>
            </div>
          </div>
          <aside class="thesis-card" aria-label="USIVA planning principle">
            <span class="card-label">Planning principle</span>
            <p class="thesis-card__title">One file. One timeline. One clearly named decision.</p>
            <p>Planning can make a conversation more useful. It cannot make a school, sponsor, consular officer, government agency, or attorney decide a case in advance.</p>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="lane-heading">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-heading section-heading--split">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Choose the question first</p>
              <h2 id="lane-heading">Different stages need different planning conversations.</h2>
            </div>
            <p class="section-heading__note">These lanes describe what to organize and verify. They are not promises of eligibility, approval, representation, or employment.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="lane-grid">
            <article class="lane lane--one">
              <span class="lane-number">01</span>
              <h3>Before applying</h3>
              <p class="lane-question">What evidence and timing should I clarify before I spend money or submit a packet?</p>
              <p>Passport and identity records, academic history, language evidence, funding questions, prior travel or visa history, and the items a university or program actually requests.</p>
              <a href="/tips-faq.html#readiness">Review readiness questions <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </article>
            <article class="lane lane--two">
              <span class="lane-number">02</span>
              <h3>During study or research</h3>
              <p class="lane-question">Which activity needs school, sponsor, or other authorization before it begins?</p>
              <p>Assistantships, on-campus work, research partner activity, travel, CPT questions, OPT planning, and status-maintenance conversations should be named rather than assumed.</p>
              <a href="/tips-faq.html#authorization">Open the authorization FAQ <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            </article>
            <article class="lane lane--three">
              <span class="lane-number">03</span>
              <h3>For a connected pathway</h3>
              <p class="lane-question">Who owns the next decision, and what needs to be written down before a handoff?</p>
              <p>US Fellows develops its research-pathway conversation. USIVA keeps visa-readiness, timing, and compliance questions visible alongside it.</p>
              <a href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">See the US Fellows pathway <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
            </article>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section" aria-labelledby="ledger-heading">
        <div class="wrap">
          <div class="section-heading">
            <p class="eyebrow">A service ledger</p>
            <h2 id="ledger-heading">What careful planning can put in order.</h2>
            <p>USIVA pages are built around four practical moves. Each one ends with a question for the authority that can actually confirm the answer.</p>
          </div>
          <ol class="ledger">
            <li>
              <div class="ledger-index">01</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Build a readiness file</h3>
                <p>Collect the identity, academic, funding, travel, and prior-visa records relevant to the decision in front of you.</p>
              </div>
              <p class="ledger-boundary"><strong>Verify with</strong> the university, program, sponsor, or counsel named for your situation.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="ledger-index">02</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Map the pathway</h3>
                <p>Put stages, dates, owners, documents, and unresolved questions on one page so a missed handoff is easier to see.</p>
              </div>
              <p class="ledger-boundary"><strong>Keep current</strong> when a school instruction, government source, or program term changes.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="ledger-index">03</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Name authorization boundaries</h3>
                <p>Separate study, assistantship, research exposure, internship, travel, and employment instead of treating them as interchangeable.</p>
              </div>
              <p class="ledger-boundary"><strong>Ask first</strong> before beginning an activity that may require written authorization.</p>
            </li>
            <li>
              <div class="ledger-index">04</div>
              <div>
                <h3>Leave a source trail</h3>
                <p>Save the public rule, school instruction, sponsor note, or professional advice that informed the next step, with the date checked.</p>
              </div>
              <p class="ledger-boundary"><strong>Escalate</strong> when the facts are personal, disputed, or too complex for general planning content.</p>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="guardrail" aria-labelledby="guardrail-heading">
        <div class="wrap guardrail__grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light">The line that matters</p>
            <h2 id="guardrail-heading">Good planning never outruns authorization.</h2>
            <p>USIVA can help a reader frame the question. The university, designated school official, designated sponsor, government agency, or licensed immigration attorney must provide the answer that controls the individual case.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="guardrail-list">
            <p><span>01</span><strong>Before payment</strong> confirm who is providing what, under which terms, and whether the information is current.</p>
            <p><span>02</span><strong>Before activity</strong> ask whether study, training, research, travel, or work needs written approval.</p>
            <p><span>03</span><strong>Before filing</strong> check the current government and program instructions, then seek individualized advice when needed.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section section--paper" aria-labelledby="start-heading">
        <div class="wrap start-panel">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">A useful next step</p>
            <h2 id="start-heading">Bring one decision, not your entire life story.</h2>
            <p>Start with your current stage, the activity or filing you are considering, the date that matters, and the document or instruction you cannot interpret. That is enough to begin a disciplined handoff.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="actions actions--stack">
            <a class="button button--red" href="/contacts.html">Draft the question brief</a>
            <a class="text-link" href="https://usfellows.org/apply.html">If you are exploring the R&amp;D pathway, begin with US Fellows <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="notice-band" aria-label="Important notice">
        <div class="wrap"><strong>Important:</strong> USIVA content is informational planning content. It is not individualized legal advice and does not guarantee admission, employment, funding, visa issuance, or government approval.</div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap footer-grid">
        <div>
          <a class="footer-brand" href="/">USIVA</a>
          <p>Visa-readiness and compliance planning for international study and research pathways.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="footer-label">Explore</p>
          <a href="/about.html">About USIVA</a>
          <a href="/pricing.html">Scope &amp; fees</a>
          <a href="/tips-faq.html">Tips &amp; FAQ</a>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="footer-label">Connect</p>
          <a href="/contacts.html">Start a question</a>
          <a href="https://usfellows.org/international-rd-scholars.html">US Fellows pathway ↗</a>
          <a href="/other-pages.html">Route atlas</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-disclaimer">
          <p class="footer-label">Notice</p>
          <p>USIVA is a US Council companion site. Public pages do not replace individualized advice from a licensed immigration attorney or the instructions of the relevant school, sponsor, or government agency.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="wrap footer-bottom">© 2026 USIVA · A US Council companion site.</div>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :global(*) { box-sizing: border-box; }
  :global(html) { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  :global(body) { margin: 0; background: #fbfaf7; color: #172231; font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif; line-height: 1.65; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
  :global(a) { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  :global(a:focus-visible), :global(button:focus-visible), :global(summary:focus-visible) { outline: 3px solid #d1a95e; outline-offset: 4px; }
  :global(p) { margin: 0 0 1rem; color: #5c6974; }
  :global(h1), :global(h2), :global(h3) { margin: 0 0 .7rem; color: #0a253f; font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.08; }
  :global(h1) { font-size: clamp(2.85rem, 7vw, 6.8rem); letter-spacing: -.045em; }
  :global(h2) { font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 4.3vw, 4.4rem); letter-spacing: -.035em; }
  :global(h3) { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem); }
  .wrap { width: min(1180px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
  .skip-link { position: fixed; top: -4rem; left: 1rem; z-index: 20; padding: .7rem 1rem; background: #fff; color: #0a253f; font-weight: 800; }
  .skip-link:focus { top: 1rem; }
  .utility-bar { background: #071827; color: #dce5eb; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .035em; }
  .utility-bar__inner { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1.5rem; padding-block: .55rem; }
  .utility-bar a { color: #f0d798; font-weight: 800; }
  .site-header { position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 10; background: rgba(251,250,247,.96); border-bottom: 1px solid #d9e0e3; backdrop-filter: blur(12px); }
  .header-inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 2rem; min-height: 5.5rem; }
  .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .75rem; }
  .brand-mark { display: grid; width: 2.8rem; height: 2.8rem; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #b9893e; border-radius: 50%; color: #0a253f; font: 700 .8rem Georgia, serif; box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 4px #fbfaf7, inset 0 0 0 5px #b9893e; }
  .brand-copy { display: grid; gap: .05rem; }
  .brand-copy strong { color: #0a253f; font: 700 1.45rem/1 Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .03em; }
  .brand-copy small { color: #68747d; font-size: .58rem; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  nav { display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; gap: .3rem 1.25rem; color: #334350; font-size: .84rem; font-weight: 750; }
  nav a:hover, nav a[aria-current="page"] { color: #ae403a; }
  .nav-action { padding: .55rem .8rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; color: #ae403a; }
  .service-hero { overflow: hidden; background: #e9eff0; border-bottom: 1px solid #cdd7d9; }
  .service-hero__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(18rem, .65fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 7rem); align-items: end; min-height: 39rem; padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 9rem) clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 6rem); }
  .service-hero__copy { max-width: 57rem; }
  .eyebrow, .card-label, .footer-label { display: block; margin-bottom: 1rem; color: #ae403a; font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .16em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .service-hero h1 { max-width: 58rem; }
  .lede { max-width: 49rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; color: #3d4d57; font-size: clamp(1.12rem, 1.8vw, 1.45rem); line-height: 1.5; }
  .actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .75rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .button { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; min-height: 3rem; padding: .75rem 1.05rem; border: 1px solid #ae403a; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .button--gold { border-color: #c49a4f; background: #c49a4f; color: #071827; }
  .button--quiet { border-color: #6c7b83; color: #263844; }
  .button--red { background: #ae403a; color: #fff; }
  .button:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .thesis-card { max-width: 24rem; padding: 1.75rem; border-top: 5px solid #c49a4f; background: #fff; box-shadow: 1.2rem 1.2rem 0 rgba(10,37,63,.09); }
  .thesis-card .card-label { margin-bottom: .7rem; }
  .thesis-card__title { margin-bottom: .9rem; color: #0a253f; font: 600 clamp(1.55rem, 2.5vw, 2.2rem)/1.1 Georgia, serif; }
  .thesis-card p:last-child { margin: 0; font-size: .9rem; }
  .section { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 8rem); }
  .section--paper { background: #f2ede4; border-block: 1px solid #e0d9cd; }
  .section-heading { max-width: 53rem; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .section-heading--split { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(16rem, .7fr); gap: 3rem; max-width: none; align-items: end; }
  .section-heading__note { max-width: 26rem; margin-bottom: .6rem; font-size: .92rem; }
  .section-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 42rem; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .lane-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px; background: #cfd8d9; border: 1px solid #cfd8d9; }
  .lane { min-height: 25rem; padding: 1.7rem; background: #fbfaf7; }
  .lane--two { background: #e3eceb; }
  .lane--three { background: #0e334f; }
  .lane--three h3, .lane--three p, .lane--three a { color: #fff; }
  .lane--three .lane-question { color: #e9d49a; }
  .lane-number { display: block; margin-bottom: 4rem; color: #ae403a; font: 700 .8rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; letter-spacing: .12em; }
  .lane--three .lane-number { color: #efd69b; }
  .lane h3 { font-size: 1.8rem; }
  .lane-question { min-height: 5.3rem; color: #0a253f; font: 600 1.2rem/1.24 Georgia, serif; }
  .lane a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .8rem; color: #ae403a; font-size: .8rem; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .lane--three a { color: #f0d798; }
  .ledger { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border-top: 1px solid #becbd0; }
  .ledger li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 4rem minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(14rem, .65fr); gap: 1.5rem; align-items: start; padding: 1.8rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #becbd0; }
  .ledger-index { color: #ae403a; font: 700 .8rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .ledger h3 { margin-bottom: .35rem; font-size: 1.65rem; }
  .ledger p { margin: 0; }
  .ledger-boundary { padding-left: 1.2rem; border-left: 2px solid #c49a4f; font-size: .9rem; }
  .ledger-boundary strong { display: block; margin-bottom: .25rem; color: #0a253f; font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .guardrail { padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); background: #071827; color: #eef2f3; }
  .guardrail__grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .9fr) minmax(18rem, 1.1fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 8rem); }
  .guardrail h2 { color: #fff; }
  .guardrail p { color: #d5e0e5; }
  .eyebrow--light { color: #efd69b; }
  .guardrail-list { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); }
  .guardrail-list p { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2.3rem 1fr; column-gap: 1rem; margin: 0; padding: 1.1rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22); }
  .guardrail-list span { color: #efd69b; font: 700 .75rem ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .guardrail-list strong { display: block; color: #fff; }
  .start-panel { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(15rem, .45fr); gap: 3rem; align-items: end; }
  .start-panel p { max-width: 43rem; font-size: 1.08rem; }
  .actions--stack { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; margin-top: 0; }
  .text-link { color: #ae403a; font-size: .88rem; font-weight: 850; }
  .notice-band { padding-block: 1.2rem; background: #f8e7be; color: #36280e; font-size: .88rem; }
  .site-footer { padding-block: 4rem 1.5rem; background: #0b2238; color: #cad7df; }
  .footer-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .65fr .75fr 1.2fr; gap: 2rem; }
  .footer-brand { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: .8rem; color: #fff; font: 700 1.55rem Georgia, serif; letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .site-footer p { color: #b5c5cf; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a { display: block; margin: .35rem 0; color: #d9e4e9; font-size: .86rem; }
  .site-footer a:hover { color: #f0d798; }
  .footer-label { margin-bottom: .7rem; color: #efd69b; }
  .footer-disclaimer { max-width: 25rem; }
  .footer-bottom { margin-top: 3rem; padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16); color: #8ea3b0; font-size: .78rem; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .header-inner { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; padding-block: 1rem; }
    nav { justify-content: flex-start; }
    .service-hero__grid, .section-heading--split, .guardrail__grid, .start-panel { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .service-hero__grid { min-height: auto; }
    .thesis-card { max-width: none; }
    .lane-grid, .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .lane--three { grid-column: span 2; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .wrap { width: min(100% - 2rem, 1180px); }
    .utility-bar__inner { display: block; }
    .utility-bar a { display: inline-block; margin-top: .3rem; }
    .lane-grid, .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .lane--three { grid-column: auto; }
    .lane { min-height: auto; }
    .lane-number { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
    .lane-question { min-height: auto; }
    .ledger li { grid-template-columns: 2.5rem 1fr; gap: .8rem; }
    .ledger-boundary { grid-column: 2; }
    .actions .button { width: 100%; }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) { scroll-behavior: auto; }
    .button:hover { transform: none; }
  }
</style>
